{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nFz44y3fa21793715304.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>甲一籃球聯賽，崇德飛鷹以6分擊敗康仁福建。 </p><p></p><p>兩隊首節打成18平手，深色衫的飛鷹第二節打出22-10比分，半場領先12分，第三節進一步拉開，賽前三連敗的福建，第四節力追，打出33-19比分，全場最高分是福建陳文滔，有22分。飛鷹最多是取得20分的奧斯汀。</p><p></p><p>兩隊同樣三人得分雙位數，庫薩斯交出17分11籃板。飛鷹保住贏79-73，五戰三勝兩負。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.523771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:59:39.127591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:17.442300+00:00","content_hash":"cda2ce8f4482215b2091b107bfe8ead6c793faf3b2c15decf978c6f8bb5fb53a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.523771+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}